      "count": 6
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain a simple <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a> capable of instantiating <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>\nimplementations via their default <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Constructor.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang.reflect\"><code>Constructor</code></a> or in case of an <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Enum.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\"><code>Enum</code></a> accessing the\nfirst enum value.",
      "translation": "获取一个简单的 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a>，该工厂能够通过其默认的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/reflect/Constructor.html\" title=\"java.lang.reflect 中的类或接口\"><code>Constructor</code></a> 实例化 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> 实现；或者在涉及 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Enum.html\" title=\"java.lang 中的类或接口\"><code>Enum</code></a> 时，访问其第一个枚举值。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain a <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a> capable of looking up/creating the <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>\nvia the given <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取一个 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a>，该工厂能够通过给定的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/beans/factory/BeanFactory.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.beans.factory\"><code>BeanFactory</code></a> 查找或创建 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain a <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a> that will cache <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> instances per\n<a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取一个 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a>，该工厂将按 <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a> 缓存 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> 实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain a <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a> that will try to obtain a <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> from the\ngiven list of <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>factories</code></a> by returning the first non null one.",
      "translation": "获取一个<a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a>，该工厂将从给定的<a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>factories</code></a>列表中尝试获取一个<a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>，方法是返回第一个非 null 的实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain a <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a> that will try to obtain a <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> from the\ngiven array of <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>factories</code></a> by returning the first non null one.",
      "translation": "获取一个<a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a>，该工厂将从给定的<a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>factories</code></a>数组中尝试获取一个<a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>，方法是返回第一个非 null 的实例。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Obtain a <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a> capable of looking up the <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> in the\ngiven <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterRegistrar.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterRegistrar</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取一个能够根据给定的<a href=\"PropertyValueConverterRegistrar.html\" title=\"类在 org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterRegistrar</code></a>查找<a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>的<a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"接口在 org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverterFactory</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a> applicable for the given <a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.mapping\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>.",
      "translation": "获取适用于给定<a href=\"../mapping/PersistentProperty.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.mapping 中的接口\"><code>PersistentProperty</code></a>的<a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>PropertyValueConverter</code></a>。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Get the converter by its type.",
      "translation": "根据类型获取转换器。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "can be null.",
      "translation": "可以为空。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Depending on the applications' need <a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>factories</code></a> can be <a href=\"#chained(java.util.List)\"><code>chained</code></a> and the resulting <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.data.convert\"><code>converter</code></a> may be\n<a href=\"#caching(org.springframework.data.convert.PropertyValueConverterFactory)\"><code>cached</code></a>.",
      "translation": "根据应用程序的需求，<a href=\"PropertyValueConverterFactory.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>factories</code></a> 可以<a href=\"#chained(java.util.List)\"><code>chained</code></a>（链式组合），生成的 <a href=\"PropertyValueConverter.html\" title=\"org.springframework.data.convert 中的接口\"><code>converter</code></a> 可能还会被<a href=\"#caching(org.springframework.data.convert.PropertyValueConverterFactory)\"><code>cached</code></a>（缓存）。",
